  "body": "## Summary\n\nBrings `docs/delivery/progress.md` in line with what actually landed: 390 recorded requirements (not 0), the first green CI run with its real counts, the two CI defects that were found and fixed, and a Cycle 1 log entry.\n\n## Requirement traceability\n\n| Requirement IDs | Contract reference |\n| --- | --- |\n| REQ-CTR-0xx (progress reporting, ماده ۳ / ماده ۴ بند ۱) | page 2-3 |\n\n## Type of change\n\n- [x] Documentation\n\n## How this was verified\n\n- `docs/README.md` internal links: 0 broken (script check)\n- CI green on the base commit 610df85: Pint 31 files, PHPStan no errors, Pest 14 passed (26 assertions)\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Requirement IDs listed and traceable\n- [x] No secrets, tokens, real PII in the diff\n- [x] Numbers in the log match the CI run, not a summary\n",
